title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/cursor:descend
catalog: GUI command
target: cursor:descend
summary: Take a panel into the row under its cursor (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``enter`` → ``cursor:descend self`` (in the ``log`` panel)
* ``enter`` → ``cursor:descend self`` (in the ``treeref`` panel)
* ``right`` → ``cursor:descend self``
